  "releaseNotes": "### 🚀 Features\n\n* Adds codecs (#247) ([d7322a4](https://github.com/thoth-org/Thoth.Json/commit/d7322a4c40cd20bd3660e60696bd3e7024f8a972))\n* Add DecodeOptions.ExactNumbers to Thoth.Json.JavaScript ([471dc51](https://github.com/thoth-org/Thoth.Json/commit/471dc51d559562329bc1a586802a7bce6ab3944f))\n\n### 🐞 Bug Fixes\n\n* Handle int64 and uint64 outside of float precision (#244) ([feb96ac](https://github.com/thoth-org/Thoth.Json/commit/feb96ac397da85eed4555888ae88a169af4308a6))\n* UnsafeFromString raises instead of returning a Result for a codec ([c49460a](https://github.com/thoth-org/Thoth.Json/commit/c49460a4dac335c65acab680743127abc51586c2))\n\n<strong><small>[View changes on Github](https://github.com/thoth-org/Thoth.Json/compare/c05798f7f81cf131ec882f6be9c587529afa9cb9..581fd36fef81aaae62cdde3bf4821d2dcbc98558)</small></strong>",
